BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Center for Social Innovation / Haas Center for Public Service] St
 anford Award for the Advancement of the Common Good\, Honoring Jacqueline 
 Novogratz\, MBA ’91
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T184500
DTSTAMP:20261002T181401Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53870657085179-53870657086204@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we honor Jacqueline Novogratz\, MBA'91\, with the S
 tanford Award for the Advancement of the Common Good.\n\nAs founder and CE
 O of the global impact investment organization Acumen\, Novogratz advanced
  the model of “patient capital\,” investing in social enterprises and 
 developing ethical leaders to build markets that provide essential service
