SUMMARY:[Office of Substance Use Programs Education & Resources (SUPER)] L
 earn about Consent & Communication (CoCo Workshop) + Free Boba!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T200000
DTSTAMP:20261002T181401Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-54004200169921-54004200170946@local-events
DESCRIPTION:What is CoCo?\n\nConsent is present in all relationships\, int
 eractions\, and situations. The Consent & Communication (CoCo) Workshop ai
 ms to give students a clear understanding of affirmative consent as an ong
 oing\, mutual\, and freely given practice while building confidence in com
 municating boundaries\, desires\, and expectations within relationships an
 d communities. Join us for this 60 minute session and learn to build a cul
 ture of consent alongside us! \n\nYou can find our list of training dates 
 belo\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1ZnLgyf3YM
 fk8-GEIcOtaPpXCYpu9mLKzjNpyM4d2LdU/preview\nLast synced: 2026-10-02 11:14 
 PDT
